{
  "//": "THE HOUSEHOLD — scenes for the dynasty layer's engine-written flags (GDD §14/§18): regent (the adult ruling for a child head), came_of_age (a child turns sixteen — content clears), parvenu (the old blood sneers at a risen house), knife_turned (an attempt on your blood was traced), plot_exposed (your own plot was traced). All clear the flag they read.",
